  "deletedBy": null,
  "details": "• Current Issue: The YT-DLP version 2023.10.13 in VRChat is outdated, causing incomplete data retrieval for YouTube videos. Consequently, videos are only available in 360P instead of the higher 720P quality.\n\n• Solution: The nightly build of YT-DLP, version 2024.03.08.232718, fixes this, allowing access to 720P streams.\n\n• Images provides showing the difference in streams provides by both the current version of YT-DLP in VRChat, and the nightly version.",
